Title:  Give them the third best

Seq:    12.6.174.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Watson-Watt, Robert|Robert Watson-Watt]]

Timestamp: 20251117230054

Date Added: 2025-11-17 16:00:54 -0700

Date Modified: 2026-10-15 12:27:06 -0600

Referenced In: We do not demand perfection

Body:

Give them the third best to go on with; the second best comes too late, the best never comes.

